{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12201200","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12201200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:4:1220120001:0":{"text":"열쇠를 찾았어요? 조나단은요? 왜 같이 안 왔어요?","source_cn":"你们拿到钥匙了？乔纳森呢？他怎么没和你们一起回来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB87813350E2CCECD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220120002:0":{"text":"세실리아?! 다, 당신 왜...","source_cn":"塞西莉亚？！你、你这个样子是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56F02724F8CEEEE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1220120002":{"text":"세실리아?! 다, 당신 왜...","source_cn":"塞西莉亚？！你、你这个样子是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56F02724F8CEEEE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220120003:0":{"text":"아... 그렇군요, 저는 이미...","source_cn":"……啊，是这样啊，原来我早已经……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE66CC2D57627BAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220120004:1":{"text":"세실리아...","source_cn":"塞西莉亚小姐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBFA56C7FBECA25A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220120005:0":{"text":"생각났어요. 그레이브본 해적이 왔을 때 다들 도망가고 있었는데...","source_cn":"我想起来了，亡灵海盗来的时候，大家都在奔逃……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91B1FF57C973FCAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220120006:0":{"text":"조나단이 저를 이곳에 가두면서 자기가 돌아올 때까지 버티고 있으라고 했어요.","source_cn":"乔纳森把我藏在了这个房间里，让我坚持住，一定要等他回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD05A878A0D8E68DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220120007:0":{"text":"그래서 저는 꾹 참고 기다렸죠.","source_cn":"所以我坚持着，等待着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3778FF3B43CB550B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220120008:0":{"text":"그런데 시간이 굉장히 오래 지났나 봐요... 나 자신이 죽었다는 것도 잊을 정도로 말이에요.","source_cn":"原来已经过了这么久啊……久到我连自己已经死去这件事都忘记了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x191AD6A38883916A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220120009:0":{"text":"... 미안해요, 세실리아... 흑흑, 저는 말 못 하겠어요!","source_cn":"……很抱歉，塞西莉亚……呜，我说不下去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE47D9AEABCC0B5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220120010:0":{"text":"세실리아... 사실은 조나단이요...","source_cn":"塞西莉亚……乔纳森他、他其实……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1220F2E08407F55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1220120011:0":{"text":"죽었겠죠. 저도 짐작하고 있었어요... 살아있었다면 저를 혼자 이곳에 두지 않았을 테니까요.","source_cn":"他去世了吧。我应该知道的……毕竟，如果他还活着，不会让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CB59F8ACE5C3CCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220120012:0":{"text":"우리는 싸우더라도 이틀이면 화해했는데... 이렇게 오래 떨어져 있어 본 적이 없어요.","source_cn":"我们就算吵架，没有两天也一定会和好……我们从来没有分开...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AEA9A96E77B64B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220120013:0":{"text":"여러분이 문을 열었다는 건, 이미 조나단을 찾았다는 거죠?","source_cn":"你们能打开房门，说明已经找到乔纳森了，对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x383099A98487A8E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220120014:0":{"text":"조나단을 만나게 해주세요... 유령이 되었더라도 조나단을 보고 싶어요.","source_cn":"请带我去见他吧……即便已经成为幽灵，我也想再见他一面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB12041BB8B1FB115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"유령 같아 보여","source_cn":"你看起来像是幽灵","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1AAD